          "reasons": [
           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/xw872bc8052#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Grey-green paper. Crop 1 carries 2622 alone, crop 3 the number 321, crop 5 the printed label 'WELTE-MIGNON. No. 321 / Carneval / Part 1 / R. Schumann'. Since the roll's number is written separately as 321, the four figures are taken as a compressed 2.6.22, on the pattern of 14114 = 14.1.1914; the grouping is inferred, not written"
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
